1
00:00:00,095 --> 00:00:02,385
- You know what would be nice?
- What's that?

2
00:00:02,598 --> 00:00:07,228
(Sheldon:)As a symbolic gesture to all the bullies
who've tormented us for years...

3
00:00:07,436 --> 00:00:12,646
(Sheldon:)...we open our home to Jimmy,
and once he's asleep, we kill him.

4
00:00:18,196 --> 00:00:21,366
(Sheldon:)I said it would be nice.
I didn't say we should do it.

5
00:00:23,952 --> 00:00:26,662
Oh. I feel just like Mother Teresa.

6
00:00:26,872 --> 00:00:29,792
(Penny:)Except for the virgin part.
That ship sailed a long time ago.

7
00:00:32,336 --> 00:00:36,126
(Bernadette:)I think Mother Teresa
would've washed the clothes first.

8
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:39,970
(Penny:)Yeah, well, I bet her laundry room
wasn't down five flights of stairs.

9
00:00:41,011 --> 00:00:43,551
(Penny:)You know, giving really
is better than receiving.

10
00:00:43,764 --> 00:00:47,604
Oh. I used to think it was such a cliché,
but it seems to be the...

11
00:00:47,809 --> 00:00:51,309
Ah! Look at these cute jeans
someone just threw away.

12
00:00:52,147 --> 00:00:53,227
(Bernadette:)Donated.

13
00:00:56,193 --> 00:01:00,023
(Penny:)Yes, to a poor waitress
who loves a boot-cut.

